{"unit_id":"DWJZ__dsh-allow#card-zh","repo":"DWJZ/dsh-allow","commit":"244e775e978dd240fd8808295c6603bbc06a9000","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-allow 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的文件权限插件，按路径和 read、write、create、delete、execute 能力评估 shell 调用，并把授权策略接入工具执行前的判定流程。它提供拒绝、允许一次和持久授权的审批方式，可用 /allow 查看或修改规则，并在界面显示审批卡片与会话判定记录。macOS 上还可把规则编译进 Seatbelt 进程限制。适合需要逐路径管理 DSH 命令权限的开发工作流；规则与审计记录保存在本机 DSH home。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:1087-1148","src/decide.js:33-63","client/client.js:666-734","src/enforce.js:274-307"]}
{"unit_id":"DWJZ__dsh-allow#card-en","repo":"DWJZ/dsh-allow","commit":"244e775e978dd240fd8808295c6603bbc06a9000","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-allow manages DSH shell permissions by path and capability. It checks read, write, create, delete, and execute access before commands run. Users can deny access, allow once, or save rules with /allow. The web client shows approval cards; macOS can apply rules through Seatbelt.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:1087-1148","src/decide.js:33-63","client/client.js:666-734","src/enforce.js:274-307"]}
